<view class="hear-page page-with-bg">
  <image class="page-bg" src="/assets/study-bg.png" mode="widthFix" aria-hidden="true" />

  <view class="hear-content">
    <view class="hear-hero">
      <view class="hear-hero__copy">
        <view class="hear-hero__title">声音如何被“听见”</view>
        <view class="hear-hero__subtitle">从声音进入，到大脑理解</view>
        <view class="hear-hero__desc">这页重点看两件事：人工耳蜗如何处理声音，以及一句“你好”会经历怎样的旅程。</view>
      </view>
      <image
        class="hear-hero__art"
        src="/assets/icons/learn-hear-hero.svg"
        mode="aspectFit"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="essay-section">
      <view class="section-title">它如何“听见”</view>
      <view class="section-copy">健康的耳朵依靠耳蜗里的毛细胞形成精细的频率响应。人工耳蜗绕过受损的毛细胞，通过一排电极对听神经进行电刺激。</view>
      <view class="section-copy">它传递的信息，本质上就是把声音分成几个频段，并保留每个频段的“响度包络”。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="principle-grid">
      <view class="principle-card">
        <view class="step-label"><view class="step-dot"></view><text>步骤 01</text></view>
        <view class="step-title">分成几个频段</view>
        <view class="step-desc">麦克风捕捉声音后，按频率拆成几个通道，对应耳蜗上的不同位置。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="principle-card">
        <view class="step-label"><view class="step-dot"></view><text>步骤 02</text></view>
        <view class="step-title">取出包络</view>
        <view class="step-desc">每个频段只保留响度随时间上升、下降的轮廓，舍弃精细波形。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="principle-card">
        <view class="step-label"><view class="step-dot"></view><text>步骤 03</text></view>
        <view class="step-title">重新合成</view>
        <view class="step-desc">模拟器用载波填充每个频段，让用户听到被压缩后的声音信息。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="principle-card">
        <view class="step-label"><view class="step-dot"></view><text>步骤 04</text></view>
        <view class="step-title">刺激/回放</view>
        <view class="step-desc">真实设备会把这些信号转换成听神经上的电脉冲；模拟器则播放给你听。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="essay-section journey-section">
      <view class="section-title section-title--mark">一句“你好”的旅程</view>
      <view class="section-copy">从空气中的声波到大脑“听到”声音，声音会经过多个阶段。跟着图中的点，看植入体如何接管原本属于耳朵的功能。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="journey-map">
      <view class="map-label">声音 · 信号 · 尖峰 · 感知</view>

      <view class="journey-stage">
        <view class="journey-band">
          <text class="journey-band__left">信息丰富</text>
          <text class="journey-band__right">压缩成少数通道</text>
        </view>

        <view class="journey-stage__body">
          <canvas
            type="2d"
            id="journeyCanvas"
            class="journey-canvas"
          ></canvas>

          <view class="journey-nodes" aria-hidden="true">
            <view class="journey-node" style="left: 8%;">
              <view class="journey-node__circle journey-node__circle--sound">
                <hlm-icon name="learn-hear-air" size="34" color="#7DC93F" />
              </view>
              <text class="journey-node__label">声音</text>
            </view>
            <view class="journey-node" style="left: 36%;">
              <view class="journey-node__circle journey-node__circle--proc">
                <hlm-icon name="learn-hear-processor" size="34" color="#16B9A6" />
              </view>
              <text class="journey-node__label">处理器</text>
            </view>
            <view class="journey-node" style="left: 67%;">
              <view class="journey-node__circle journey-node__circle--elec">
                <hlm-icon name="learn-hear-electrode" size="34" color="#F2C14E" />
              </view>
              <text class="journey-node__label">电极</text>
            </view>
            <view class="journey-node" style="left: 91%;">
              <view class="journey-node__circle journey-node__circle--brain">
                <hlm-icon name="learn-hear-brain" size="34" color="#1E7CC2" />
              </view>
              <text class="journey-node__label">大脑</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="journey-flow" aria-label="声音处理流程">
          <view class="journey-flow__step journey-flow__step--sound">
            <view class="journey-flow__dot"></view>
            <text>声波进入</text>
          </view>
          <text class="journey-flow__arrow">›</text>
          <view class="journey-flow__step journey-flow__step--proc">
            <view class="journey-flow__dot"></view>
            <text>提取包络</text>
          </view>
          <text class="journey-flow__arrow">›</text>
          <view class="journey-flow__step journey-flow__step--elec">
            <view class="journey-flow__dot"></view>
            <text>转为电刺激</text>
          </view>
          <text class="journey-flow__arrow">›</text>
          <view class="journey-flow__step journey-flow__step--brain">
            <view class="journey-flow__dot"></view>
            <text>大脑解码</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="note-card">
      <view class="note-title">理解重点</view>
      <view class="note-text">绿点代表声音信息。在“处理器”处，信息被压缩成几个通道；一旦信息在这里丢失，就无法在下游完全恢复。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
